      "text": "27.03.2026 (S.K. Medhi, J) This is an appeal preferred from Jail against the judgment and order dated 03.10.2025 passed by the Addl. Sessions Judge No.1 & Special Judge (POCSO), Nagaon in Special (POCSO) Case No. 124/2024; convicted u/s 376(3)/506 IPC r/w Section 6 of POCSO Act and to undergo RI for life and fine of Rs.10,000/-, i.d. to undergo RI for 1 year and RI for 1 year and fine of Rs.5,000/- i.d., RI for Page No.# 2/2 1 month.",
